# Validation 01: parallel execution.
# Three independent LOADs populate R5, R6, R7 from three
# different addresses, then three independent ADDs write
# R1, R2, R3 from them. With Tomasulo all three pairs can
# execute in parallel because no ADD's source depends on
# another ADD's destination.
LOAD R5, 100(R0)
LOAD R6, 200(R0)
LOAD R7, 300(R0)
ADD R1, R5, R0
ADD R2, R6, R0
ADD R3, R7, R0
h
